                        "target_lang_word": "Beisetzung",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Beisetzung",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "44c9015b-9f8a-3dac-a22d-dcef9f6b23f7",
                                        "entry_id": "27adcb23-4b97-39a1-a69e-2b29bfbb975a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Bestattung der sterblichen Überreste"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b0ba20cd-aca9-430b-99e5-592c825c2d86",
                                                "sense_id": "44c9015b-9f8a-3dac-a22d-dcef9f6b23f7",
                                                "text": "Die Beisetzung fand im engsten Familienkreis statt."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cb2f612f-10cc-467e-b07c-60dd06dcd0fa",
                                                "sense_id": "44c9015b-9f8a-3dac-a22d-dcef9f6b23f7",
                                                "text": "„Danach ging es im Kondukt zur Beisetzung auf dem Friedhof gleich nebenan.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5523b61a-c261-460c-a7cd-a2946e050ee3",
                                                "sense_id": "44c9015b-9f8a-3dac-a22d-dcef9f6b23f7",
                                                "text": "„Nach der Beisetzung und dem Trauergottesdienst gingen die Trauergäste zur Familie des Verstorbenen zum Essen.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "85227f8e-9fb2-40f0-a022-940c71e32501",
                        "source_entry_id": "e63ddbbc-b8f5-3ecf-9de9-b708dca67836",
                        "source_sense_id": "aa9de851-15ee-3eab-9eea-404ce9595cfe",
                        "source_sense_description": "een ceremonie waarbij een overledene in een kist aan de aarde wordt toevertrouwd",
                        "target_lang_word": "burial",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "burial",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fc5eda4b-2c44-3eeb-9dae-9f6729dc3be5",
                                        "entry_id": "e5dd8c4b-236e-35be-984a-1b718e79bf19",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The act of burying; interment; placing remains into the earth."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "027a1b24-0068-4a22-a6d0-45a77cbddb43",
                                                "sense_id": "fc5eda4b-2c44-3eeb-9dae-9f6729dc3be5",
                                                "text": "His whole family was present at his burial."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9e0e37eb-fc94-424b-8271-9f037bffeefc",
                                                "sense_id": "fc5eda4b-2c44-3eeb-9dae-9f6729dc3be5",
                                                "text": "The mourners listened as the priest performed the burial service of long-time parishioner Wendy Stuart."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ae75cfba-8744-4e80-9667-c5f9dd5fffa7",
                                                "sense_id": "fc5eda4b-2c44-3eeb-9dae-9f6729dc3be5",
                                                "text": "A dreary year for the Squadron, this 1819, when officers and men fell sick by the shipload and were sent home by the tenderful, when Lemon Valley Hospital was supplemented by the one at High Peak, when Court-Martials were held at the rate of one a fortnight, burials thrice a week, and surveys on foul provisions every other day!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "60db26b1-1add-4e85-983b-35835634c1fb",
                                                "sense_id": "fc5eda4b-2c44-3eeb-9dae-9f6729dc3be5",
                                                "text": "However, many Cromlechs and Dolmins are carelessly called \"Druid's circles\", when in reality they were the burial places of ancient chieftains and their households[.]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "7f9a9a24-98d6-4544-b377-03b993dff067",
                        "source_entry_id": "e63ddbbc-b8f5-3ecf-9de9-b708dca67836",
                        "source_sense_id": "aa9de851-15ee-3eab-9eea-404ce9595cfe",
                        "source_sense_description": "een ceremonie waarbij een overledene in een kist aan de aarde wordt toevertrouwd",
                        "target_lang_word": "funeral",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "funeral",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "df65c748-87c9-3a2e-b07b-6de657f1bb5d",
                                        "entry_id": "7ade1cfe-49be-36b8-8752-4901b71e3f59",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A ceremony to honor and remember a deceased person, often distinguished from a memorial service by the presence of the body of the deceased."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "22ccce80-a10c-4019-8f2b-b47136cdb65a",
                                                "sense_id": "df65c748-87c9-3a2e-b07b-6de657f1bb5d",
                                                "text": "Many mourners turned up at the local artist's funeral to pay homage."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "67d4b5b4-971e-4cd9-a192-1335652d2f48",
                                                "sense_id": "df65c748-87c9-3a2e-b07b-6de657f1bb5d",
                                                "text": "The taking Away of Righteous & Merciful Perſons muſt be taken to Heart, APPLIED IN A SERMON AT THE FUNERALLS OF Mʳⁱˢ ANNE-MARY CHILD. Wife of THOMAS CHILD Eſq. of North-wick in the Pariſh of Blockley. Worceſter-ſhire.[…]TO THE Exemplarily Vertuous Gentle-woman, his much honoured friend, Mʳˢ ANNE CHILD, Eldeſt daughter of THOMAS CHILD of Northwicke Eſquire. AS I mean not an exerciſe for your modeſty by a flattering Epiſtle, ſo neither doe I intend the renewing of your ſorrows, by preſenting you with the plaine Sermon preach’t at the funerals of your bleſſed Mother."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "272ba5b9-e2ff-3a5c-8387-ee7471d5f11d",
                                        "entry_id": "7ade1cfe-49be-36b8-8752-4901b71e3f59",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A funeral sermon."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "dated",
                                            "in-plural"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "funeral",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6c07c695-0466-35bf-82ed-a285b8372b3d",
                                        "entry_id": "f093c63b-2704-334c-ac96-57861e1b64b1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Alternative spelling of funereal."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "alt-of",
                                            "alternative",
                                            "not-comparable",
                                            "uncommon",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c96085d9-c6c9-48ac-935b-5754718bd509",
                                                "sense_id": "6c07c695-0466-35bf-82ed-a285b8372b3d",
                                                "text": "All was funeral gloom and hope never whispered its cheering promises there."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0aa06d08-de3b-4065-a7c9-78fd71443211",
                                                "sense_id": "6c07c695-0466-35bf-82ed-a285b8372b3d",
                                                "text": "Indeed I felt it altogether beautiful; and, as the \"dying day-hymn stole aloft,\" the dim sun-beams fell, through a vista of naked motionless trees, upon the coffin, which was borne with a slower and more funeral pace than before, in a manner that threw a solemn and visionary light upon the whole procession."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f594f0c3-d855-4c30-a42b-803e08f4cebb",
                                                "sense_id": "6c07c695-0466-35bf-82ed-a285b8372b3d",
                                                "text": "There was something dramatic and theatrical in the very funeral ceremonies with which Demetrius was honored."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fa36a62a-29fc-41a6-982e-ca33586c6e53",
                                                "sense_id": "6c07c695-0466-35bf-82ed-a285b8372b3d",
                                                "text": "The very funeral pageantry disguised behind-the-scenes struggles for control over Sidney's image."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "6afbec38-4a80-4aee-b895-dec1855699ba",
                        "source_entry_id": "e63ddbbc-b8f5-3ecf-9de9-b708dca67836",
                        "source_sense_id": "aa9de851-15ee-3eab-9eea-404ce9595cfe",
                        "source_sense_description": "een ceremonie waarbij een overledene in een kist aan de aarde wordt toevertrouwd",
                        "target_lang_word": "enterrement",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "enterrement",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "31ed9f7f-97ac-304a-b2ba-24fddf7d3d03",
                                        "entry_id": "1838bb7d-d0ea-3b7c-9857-cd38c2107388",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Cérémonies qu’on observe pour porter et mettre un corps en terre."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Funéraire"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9fafe200-21ca-4f14-9c49-1f85991c74d6",
                                                "sense_id": "31ed9f7f-97ac-304a-b2ba-24fddf7d3d03",
                                                "text": "A mon enterrement je ne veux que des morts\nDes rossignols sans voix des chagrins littéraires\nDes peintres sans couleurs des acteurs sans décor\nDes silences sans bruits des soleils sans lumière."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4e66ad2a-2a48-486c-b2a9-ee0a6f586803",
                                                "sense_id": "31ed9f7f-97ac-304a-b2ba-24fddf7d3d03",
                                                "text": "Les tolba sont tenus d'honorer toute invitation émanant d'un membre de la communauté. Ils assistent généralement aux mariages, aux fêtes organisées à l'occasion des circoncisions, des baptêmes et des enterrements."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8ef31ee4-58b6-44d7-b04a-34a38a2c6f31",
                                                "sense_id": "31ed9f7f-97ac-304a-b2ba-24fddf7d3d03",
                                                "text": "Je m’en vais le premier, voilà tout, et je trouve ma consolation dans cette idée que je n’irai pas à votre enterrement, ce qui m’aurait fait de la peine."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f7685690-0e86-324d-af60-08d13ef08d85",
                                        "entry_id": "1838bb7d-d0ea-3b7c-9857-cd38c2107388",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Convoi funèbre."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ccb64bb2-4d1c-480f-bd7c-a9ec121c0178",
                                                "sense_id": "f7685690-0e86-324d-af60-08d13ef08d85",
                                                "text": "Mais l’institutrice débouche de la cour, distribue des gifles à qui se retourne, et le cortège s’en va alourdi et embarrassé comme un enterrement qui laissa, par mégarde, le mort à la maison. L’adjointe les suit, gaillarde, tâtant ses peignes."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "84615e41-8670-4115-a04b-a348c335b2b2",
                                                "sense_id": "f7685690-0e86-324d-af60-08d13ef08d85",
                                                "text": "Il y a un trafic de passants, de fêtes, de ces enterrements arabes glapissants qui trottent comme des champions de marche."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4b8d3e27-eab0-4f60-a65c-9a4a60e4fa54",
                                                "sense_id": "f7685690-0e86-324d-af60-08d13ef08d85",
                                                "text": "L’enterrement de mon père fut suivi de tout le village suivant la coutume et il y vint des gens des environs, à des lieues à la ronde."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6beb2503-d4e2-3950-92aa-05791a13d896",
                                        "entry_id": "1838bb7d-d0ea-3b7c-9857-cd38c2107388",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Fin d’un projet, d’une promesse."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "06590ce8-f992-42ab-a393-8dd56f850dbc",
                                                "sense_id": "6beb2503-d4e2-3950-92aa-05791a13d896",
                                                "text": "Même cette classe unique finit par disparaître quelques années après la mise en place d'un regroupement à trois niveaux, Termes, Senuc, Montcheutin. […]. Il faut dire que l'on fit un bel enterrement à cette école de Montcheutin. Et même, c'est elle qui se chargea des fleurs de ses obsèques."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5361deac-85ec-426f-af5b-e993022c176a",
                                                "sense_id": "6beb2503-d4e2-3950-92aa-05791a13d896",
                                                "text": "L’enterrement d’un projet."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ee4d7b41-b332-431f-95a6-79398a8e2e0e",
                        "source_entry_id": "e63ddbbc-b8f5-3ecf-9de9-b708dca67836",
